# Added by git standards propagation
Thumbs.db
build/
dist/
*.swp
# package-lock.json is committed, as in every other Node repository in this
# estate (7 of 9 track one). Ignoring it here meant CI and Netlify resolved
# react, vite, recharts and tailwind afresh on every build inside their ^
# ranges, so a build could break with no commit behind it.
